## TableLoadHelper – Enterprise Data Load Automation Tool

TableLoadHelper is a custom internal automation tool designed to streamline and standardize enterprise data load workflows during large-scale system conversions.

### Problem
Manual Excel-to-XML data preparation introduced:
- High error rates
- Inconsistent formatting
- Late-stage load failures
- Significant analyst and engineering overhead

### Solution
TableLoadHelper automates the data load preparation process by:
- Validating structured Excel templates
- Applying schema-aware transformations
- Detecting and reporting errors prior to load
- Generating load-ready XML artifacts

